#. module: equity
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:equity.portal_ubo_form
msgid ""
"Beneficial owners are natural person(s) who ultimately own(s) or control(s) "
"the customer or the natural person(s)\n"
"                    for whose account or on whose behalf a transaction is "
"being conducted or a business relationship is established. It\n"
"                    includes those natural persons that do not have a "
"controlling holding in the company or a formal mandate of any kind\n"
"                    but who are de facto exercising similar control over the "
"company."
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ຮັບຜົນປະໂຫຍດທີ່ແທ້ຈິງແມ່ນບຸກຄົນທຳມະດາທີ່ເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງ ຫຼື ຄວບຄຸມລູກຄ້າໃນຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍ ຫຼື ບຸກຄົນທຳມະດາ\n"
"                    ທີ່ການດຳເນີນທຸລະກຳ ຫຼື ການສ້າງສາຍພົວພັນທາງທຸລະກິດຕ່າງໆ ແມ່ນດຳເນີນໄປເພື່ອຜົ"
"ນປະໂຫຍດ ຫຼື ໃນນາມຂອງພວກເຂົາ.\n"
